# Personal overlay

This checkout is a personal overlay of pingdotgg/t3code. It is not upstream.

- Daily mobile is the **App Store** binary, not `apps/mobile` in this repo. Those clients do not ship together.
- Protocol floor: every field that store mobile still decodes. Additive only: new optional fields, new RPCs. Never remove or rename a field a store client requires.
- `ReviewDiffPreviewSource` must keep `diff` (unified patch) **and** `files`. Desktop reads `files`; store 1.0.3 reads `diff`.
- New UI belongs in new files `main` will never touch. `DiffPanel.tsx` is a re-export of `ThreadDiffPanel.tsx`. Future merges: keep-ours on that re-export.
- Do not add a viewer toggle. Do not assume a Personal Team iOS install (7-day expiry).
- Longer policy: `docs/internals/personal-overlay.md`.
